    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main0750_rival_01",
      "hash": "1bd57eca7739e1a5",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR RIVALNAME(0001)]: So that’s Cubone’s mom...?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0750_youngf_01",
      "hash": "fb5851dcba957e7d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "GIRL: That’s right!\\c\\nTeam Rocket keeps on going after Marowak so\\nit can sell those skulls they wear for profit...\\c\\nI think Cubone is still looking for its mother,\\neven though she’s gone...\\c\\nI just can’t forgive that Team Rocket!"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0750_rival_02",
      "hash": "1bd57bca7739dc8c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR RIVALNAME(0001)]: Me neither!\\c\\nI saw Cubone heading into the tower a little\\nwhile ago, too...\\c\\nI’ll go look for it—and I’ll keep an eye out for\\nthat Mr. Fuji, too! The one who’s been missing!"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0750_youngf_02",
      "hash": "fb584edcba957964",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "GIRL: Thank you...\\nAnd be careful!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0750_rival_03",
      "hash": "1bd57cca7739de3f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR RIVALNAME(0001)]: I r-really don’t like ghosts...\\nBut I’ve gotta do this!"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0750_rival_04",
